// Your own widget bar entries. Save the file and they apply at once.
//
// Every entry here is merged over the built-in ones. A new key adds a button to the
// widget bar; a built-in key, such as "defwidget@swarm", replaces that button. The built-in
// entries are in crates/srv-core/src/config/widgets.json in the AgentMux source.
// Comments (// and /* */) and trailing commas are allowed. If the file has a mistake,
// Settings names the line, and your widgets stay as they were until it is fixed.
//
// To add a new kind of pane, install a widget instead (Settings, Widgets): it runs
// sandboxed and asks you first. This file only arranges the panes AgentMux already has.
//
// An entry's fields, all optional:
//   "label"            the button's name
//   "icon"             a Font Awesome icon name, without "fa-"
//   "color"            the button's colour, such as "#5865f2"
//   "description"      the tooltip
//   "display:order"    where it sits on the bar: lower comes first
//   "display:pinned"   true to pin it to the bar for a new install
//   "blockdef"         what a click opens: "meta" holds the pane's "view" (agent, browser,
//                      editor, files, ...) and the settings that pane reads, such as "url"
//   "singleton"        true to bring back the pane that is already open, not open another
//   "scope"            "window" (the default) or "app": where that open pane is looked for
//   "children"         the short names of other entries, to make this button a menu
//   "section"          the section of a pane with sections that a click opens on
//   "module"           a third-party pane's module file; it runs only after you approve it in
//                      Settings, Widgets
//
// An example, ready to use: remove the // from its lines, then change them.
{
    // "my-docs": {
    //     "label": "Docs",
    //     "icon": "book",
    //     "description": "The AgentMux docs",
    //     "display:order": 20,
    //     "display:pinned": true,
    //     "blockdef": { "meta": { "view": "browser", "url": "https://docs.agentmux.ai" } },
    // },
}
